CAIPE Sandbox

The initial portal and packaging export is based on reference implementation
snapshot 21366865181413e03a642b46a7f56559b320ec4b (5 November 2026).
It excludes the prototype demonstration site, PoC extensions, private workload
image and deployment-specific configuration. Existing documentation has been
preserved from the supplied OSS checkout.

The Agent Sandbox CRD and controller deployment definitions derive from
Kubernetes SIGs Agent Sandbox v1.0.5 (Apache License 2.0).
See charts/agent-sandbox/UPSTREAM-LICENSE.

OpenShell and Kata charts come from their upstream OCI releases and remain
subject to the licenses in NVIDIA/OpenShell and kata-containers/kata-containers.
Browser dependencies' licenses are emitted into
portal/static/licenses.txt during the build. Integration logos remain subject
to their respective owners' trademark policies.
